@*
    Home.razor  (route: "/")
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Landing Page SmartDoorAccess — versi UI yang disempurnakan.

    Perbaikan yang diterapkan:
    1. Tipografi: Plus Jakarta Sans (dari Google Fonts), hierarki
       font konsisten, warna teks lebih kontras (#CBD5E1 untuk body)
    2. Feature Cards: glassmorphism, glow icon, spacing lebih lega
    3. Auth Card: tombol Google utama menonjol, sekunder di bawah,
       border-radius lebih lembut (28px)
    4. Navbar: active state "pill" berwarna, ikon di setiap menu,
       scroll-aware shadow
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*@

@page "/"
@layout EmptyLayout

<PageTitle>SmartDoorAccess – Sistem Akses Pintu Cerdas</PageTitle>

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   NAVBAR — Sticky, glassmorphism, active-state dengan pill shape
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ *@
<nav class="lp-navbar" id="lp-navbar">

    @* ── Kiri: Logo ── *@
    <a href="/" class="lp-nav-brand">
        <div class="lp-nav-logo">🔐</div>
        <span class="lp-nav-name">
            <span class="c-smart">Smart</span><span class="c-door">Door</span><span class="c-access">Access</span>
        </span>
    </a>

    @* ── Tengah: Menu navigasi dengan ikon + active state ── *@
    <div class="lp-nav-links">
        @* 
            Setiap link memiliki:
            - Ikon emoji/SVG kecil sebagai visual cue
            - Kelas "nav-active" untuk link yang sedang aktif/di-hover
            - Efek pill (border-radius: 8px) saat aktif
        *@
        <a href="#fitur"     class="lp-nav-link" onclick="setActiveNav(this)">
            <span class="nav-icon">⚡</span> Fitur
        </a>
        <a href="#tentang"   class="lp-nav-link" onclick="setActiveNav(this)">
            <span class="nav-icon">ℹ️</span> Tentang
        </a>
        <a href="/admin"     class="lp-nav-link" onclick="setActiveNav(this)">
            <span class="nav-icon">👥</span> Kelola Admin
        </a>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="lp-nav-link" onclick="setActiveNav(this)">
            <span class="nav-icon">📊</span> Dashboard
        </a>
    </div>

    @* ── Kanan: Jam real-time + tombol CTA ── *@
    <div class="lp-nav-right">
        <RealtimeClock />
        <a href="#login" class="lp-nav-cta">
            <span>🚀</span> Masuk Sekarang
        </a>
    </div>
</nav>

@* Script kecil untuk active state navbar *@
<script>
    function setActiveNav(el) {
        document.querySelectorAll('.lp-nav-link').forEach(l => l.classList.remove('nav-active'));
        el.classList.add('nav-active');
    }
    // Scroll-aware: tambah shadow saat halaman di-scroll
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
        const nav = document.getElementById('lp-navbar');
        if (nav) nav.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 10);
    });
</script>

@* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   HERO SECTION — split layout kiri & kanan
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ *@
<div class="lp-hero" id="login">

    @* ── Panel Kiri: Hero copy + statistik + feature cards ── *@
    <div class="lp-left">

        @* Badge kecil *@
        <div class="hero-badge">
            <span class="badge-dot"></span>
            Sistem Akses Kampus Generasi Baru
        </div>

        @* Judul utama *@
        <h1 class="hero-title">
            Kendali Akses Pintu<br />
            <span class="gradient-text">Lebih Cerdas</span>
        </h1>

        @* 
            Deskripsi — warna #CBD5E1 untuk kontras optimal
            di atas latar belakang #0A0E1A
        *@
        <p class="hero-desc">
            Sistem manajemen akses berbasis RFID yang aman, termonitor, dan mudah dikelola.
            Pantau siapa yang masuk, kapan, dan dari pintu mana —
            semuanya dalam satu dashboard terpusat.
        </p>

        @* Statistik 3 kolom *@
        <div class="hero-stats">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <span class="stat-num">100%</span>
                <span class="stat-label">Terenkripsi</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-sep"></div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <span class="stat-num">24/7</span>
                <span class="stat-label">Monitoring</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-sep"></div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <span class="stat-num">RFID</span>
                <span class="stat-label">Teknologi</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        @* ── Feature Cards (glassmorphism + glow icon) ── *@
        <div class="features" id="fitur">

            @*
                Setiap kartu memiliki:
                - Ikon dalam lingkaran berpendar (glow effect)
                - Efek glassmorphism: backdrop-filter blur + border tipis bercahaya
                - Spacing yang lebih lega: gap 14px, padding 18px 22px
            *@
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrap fc-blue">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🛡️</span>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-text">
                    <strong>Akses RFID Terenkripsi</strong>
                    <p>Setiap kartu teridentifikasi unik dan aman dengan enkripsi penuh</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrap fc-indigo">
                    <span class="feature-icon">📊</span>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-text">
                    <strong>Log Aktivitas Real-time</strong>
                    <p>Rekam jejak akses kapan saja, dapat difilter dan diekspor</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrap fc-cyan">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🚪</span>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-text">
                    <strong>Multi-Pintu Terpusat</strong>
                    <p>Kelola banyak pintu dari satu panel admin yang intuitif</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    @* ── Panel Kanan: Auth Card ── *@
    <div class="lp-right">
        <div class="auth-card">

            @* Header *@
            <div class="auth-header">
                <div class="auth-icon-wrap">
                    <span class="auth-icon">🔓</span>
                </div>
                <h2>Selamat Datang</h2>
                <p>Masuk untuk mengelola sistem akses pintu Anda</p>
            </div>

            @* Divider *@
            <div class="auth-divider">
                <span>Login menggunakan</span>
            </div>

            @*
                TOMBOL UTAMA — Login Google
                Paling menonjol: background putih, teks gelap, shadow biru
                POST ke /signin-google → endpoint di Program.cs
                → Google OAuth callback → /dashboard
            *@
            <form action="/signin-google" method="post" class="auth-form-google">
                <button type="submit" class="btn-google-primary">
                    <svg class="google-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z" fill="#4285F4"/>
                        <path d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z" fill="#34A853"/>
                        <path d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l3.66-2.84z" fill="#FBBC05"/>
                        <path d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z" fill="#EA4335"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span>Masuk dengan Google</span>
                    <span class="btn-arrow">→</span>
                </button>
            </form>

            @*
                OPSI SEKUNDER — dikelompokkan di bawah divider
                Tampil lebih kecil agar fokus tetap pada tombol Google
            *@
            <div class="auth-secondary-divider">
                <span>atau akses cepat</span>
            </div>

            @* 
                Dua tombol sekunder berjajar:
                - Kelola Admin (CRUD halaman /admin)
                - Dashboard langsung
            *@
            <div class="auth-secondary-btns">
                <a href="/admin" class="btn-secondary">
                    <span>👥</span>
                    <span>Kelola Admin</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-secondary">
                    <span>📊</span>
                    <span>Dashboard</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            @* Catatan keamanan *@
            <div class="auth-note">
                <span class="note-icon">🔒</span>
                <p>Login aman via Google OAuth 2.0 · Hanya akun yang diizinkan admin yang dapat masuk</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</div>

@* Footer *@
<footer class="lp-footer" id="tentang">
    <div class="footer-inner">
        <span>🔐 <strong>SmartDoorAccess</strong> — Sistem Akses Pintu Berbasis RFID</span>
        <span class="footer-copy">© 2026 · Dibangun dengan ASP.NET Blazor</span>
    </div>
</footer>

<style>
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   DESIGN TOKENS — variabel CSS global untuk halaman ini
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
:root {
    /* Tipografi: Plus Jakarta Sans (dari Google Fonts) */
    --font: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;

    /* Palet warna utama */
    --bg:          #080c18;   /* Latar paling gelap */
    --bg-card:     #0f172a;   /* Latar kartu (sedikit lebih terang) */
    --bg-panel:    #0d1321;   /* Latar panel kiri */

    /* Teks — hierarki kontras */
    --text-h:   #F1F5F9;      /* Judul utama — hampir putih */
    --text-p:   #CBD5E1;      /* Body / deskripsi — abu-abu terang */
    --text-s:   #94A3B8;      /* Sekunder / label kecil */
    --text-m:   #64748B;      /* Muted / placeholder */

    /* Aksen warna */
    --blue:    #3B82F6;
    --blue-l:  #60A5FA;
    --indigo:  #6366F1;
    --cyan:    #06B6D4;
    --purple:  #A78BFA;

    /* Border */
    --border:      rgba(59,130,246,0.18);
    --border-soft: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);

    /* Radius */
    --r-sm:  8px;
    --r-md:  14px;
    --r-lg:  20px;
    --r-xl:  28px;    /* Border-radius kartu login — lebih lembut */
}

/* Reset dasar */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text-p);
    /* Terapkan Plus Jakarta Sans ke seluruh halaman */
    font-family: var(--font);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   NAVBAR — glassmorphism, scroll-aware, active pill
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.lp-navbar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 200;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 48px;
    height: 64px;
    background: rgba(8, 12, 24, 0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.12);
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
    gap: 24px;
}
/* Shadow muncul saat di-scroll (diatur oleh JS) */
.lp-navbar.scrolled {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}

/* ── Brand / Logo ── */
.lp-nav-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
.lp-nav-logo {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--indigo));
    width: 38px; height: 38px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(99,102,241,0.45);
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
.lp-nav-name {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
}
.c-smart  { color: var(--blue-l); }
.c-door   { color: var(--text-h); }
.c-access { color: var(--purple); }

/* ── Menu Links dengan ikon & active pill ── */
.lp-nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    flex: 1;
    justify-content: center;
}
.lp-nav-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    color: var(--text-s);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    letter-spacing: 0.1px;
}
.lp-nav-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-h);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
}
/* Active state — pill berwarna biru tipis */
.lp-nav-link.nav-active {
    color: var(--blue-l);
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
}
.nav-icon {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1;
}

/* ── Kanan: Clock + CTA ── */
.lp-nav-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
.lp-nav-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--indigo));
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(59,130,246,0.35);
    letter-spacing: 0.1px;
}
.lp-nav-cta:hover { opacity: 0.88; transform: translateY(-1px); color: #fff; }

/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   HERO — split layout
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.lp-hero {
    display: flex;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
    background: var(--bg);
    overflow: hidden;
}

/* ── Panel Kiri ── */
.lp-left {
    flex: 1.25;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 64px 56px;
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, #0d1321 0%, #121e38 55%, #0a111f 100%);
    position: relative;
}
/* Dekorasi blur di pojok */
.lp-left::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -80px; left: -80px;
    width: 420px; height: 420px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,0.13) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
}
.lp-left::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; right: 40px;
    width: 320px; height: 320px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(99,102,241,0.09) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
}

/* Badge "pill" kecil di atas judul */
.hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.28);
    color: #93C5FD;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 5px 14px 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    width: fit-content;
    letter-spacing: 0.2px;
}
.badge-dot {
    width: 7px; height: 7px;
    background: var(--blue-l);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: pulse-dot 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}
@@keyframes pulse-dot {
    0%,100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(96,165,250,0.6); }
    50%      { box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(96,165,250,0); }
}

/* Judul utama */
.hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: var(--text-h);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
}
/* Gradien biru → ungu pada "Lebih Cerdas" */
.gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-l) 0%, var(--purple) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
}

/* Paragraf deskripsi — warna #CBD5E1, lebih terang dari sebelumnya */
.hero-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-p);   /* #CBD5E1 — kontras tinggi di latar gelap */
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1px;
}

/* Statistik ringkas */
.hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 18px 24px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    width: fit-content;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}
.stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2px; }
.stat-num {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--blue-l);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}
.stat-label { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-m); font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
.stat-sep { width: 1px; height: 38px; background: var(--border-soft); }

/* ── Feature Cards — glassmorphism + glow icon ── */
.features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;   /* Spacing lebih lega dari sebelumnya (12px → 14px) */
}

/*
    Glassmorphism card:
    - background semi-transparan
    - backdrop-filter blur
    - border tipis bercahaya
    - hover: geser kanan + glow
*/
.feature-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 18px 22px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.25s, border-color 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
    cursor: default;
}
.feature-card:hover {
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.07);
    border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.28);
    transform: translateX(8px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(59,130,246,0.1);
}

/*
    Ikon lingkaran berpendar — ukuran 48x48px
    Setiap warna tema (blue, indigo, cyan) punya glow sendiri
*/
.feature-icon-wrap {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
}
/* Biru — untuk RFID */
.fc-blue {
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
}
/* Indigo — untuk Log */
.fc-indigo {
    background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(99,102,241,0.25);
}
/* Cyan — untuk Multi-Pintu */
.fc-cyan {
    background: rgba(6,182,212,0.13);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.28);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(6,182,212,0.2);
}
.feature-icon { line-height: 1; }
.feature-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
.feature-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-h);
    letter-spacing: 0.1px;
}
.feature-text p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-s);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ── Panel Kanan ── */
.lp-right {
    flex: 0.85;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    background: #0a101f;
    position: relative;
}
/* Garis pembatas vertikal */
.lp-right::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 8%; bottom: 8%;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(59,130,246,0.25), transparent);
}

/* ── Auth Card ── */
/*
    border-radius: var(--r-xl) = 28px → lebih lembut
    Padding lebih lega: 48px 40px
*/
.auth-card {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, #101728, #172038);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
    border-radius: var(--r-xl);
    padding: 44px 38px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow:
        0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.45),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04) inset;
}
/* Cahaya biru di atas kartu */
.auth-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 240px; height: 90px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.14);
    filter: blur(35px);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
}

/* Header auth card */
.auth-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
.auth-icon-wrap {
    width: 68px; height: 68px;
    background: rgba(59,130,246,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
    border-radius: 20px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
}
.auth-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    animation: float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@@keyframes float {
    0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50%      { transform: translateY(-7px); }
}
.auth-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-h);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
}
.auth-header p {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-m);
